    {
      "source": "Register <a href=\"../../../aot/hint/ReflectionHints.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aot.hint\"><code>ReflectionHints</code></a> against the specified <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/AnnotatedElement.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>AnnotatedElement</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将 `<a href=\"../../../aot/hint/ReflectionHints.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aot.hint\"><code>ReflectionHints</code></a>` 注册到指定的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/AnnotatedElement.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>AnnotatedElement</code></a>`。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../../../aot/hint/annotation/ReflectiveProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aot.hint.annotation\"><code>ReflectiveProcessor</code></a> implementation for types annotated\nwith <a href=\"MessageMapping.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>@MessageMapping</code></a>,\n<a href=\"../../simp/annotation/SubscribeMapping.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.messaging.simp.annotation\"><code>@SubscribeMapping</code></a>\nand <a href=\"MessageExceptionHandler.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>@MessageExceptionHandler</code></a>.\nIn addition to registering reflection hints for invoking\nthe annotated method, this implementation handles:\n\n<ul>\n    <li>Return types</li>\n    <li>Parameters identified as potential payloads</li>\n    <li><a href=\"../../Message.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>Message</code></a> parameters</li>\n    <li>Exception classes specified via <a href=\"MessageExceptionHandler.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>@MessageExceptionHandler</code></a></li>\n</ul>",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../../../aot/hint/annotation/ReflectiveProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aot.hint.annotation\"><code>ReflectiveProcessor</code></a> 实现用于带有 <a href=\"MessageMapping.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>@MessageMapping</code></a>、<a href=\"../../simp/annotation/SubscribeMapping.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.messaging.simp.annotation\"><code>@SubscribeMapping</code></a> 和 <a href=\"MessageExceptionHandler.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>@MessageExceptionHandler</code></a> 注解的类型。除了为调用已注解的方法注册反射提示外，该实现还处理：\n\n<ul>\n    <li>返回类型</li>\n    <li>标识为潜在有效负载的参数</li>\n    <li><a href=\"../../Message.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>Message</code></a> 参数</li>\n    <li>通过 <a href=\"MessageExceptionHandler.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>@MessageExceptionHandler</code></a> 指定的异常类</li>\n</ul>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../../aot/hint/annotation/ReflectiveProcessor.html#registerReflectionHints(org.springframework.aot.hint.ReflectionHints,java.lang.reflect.AnnotatedElement)\">ReflectiveProcessor</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../../aot/hint/annotation/ReflectiveProcessor.html#registerReflectionHints(org.springframework.aot.hint.ReflectionHints,java.lang.reflect.AnnotatedElement)\">ReflectiveProcessor</a></code></span>",
